	(text "D22 OR remote LED on J28 (1=anode, 2=cathode).\nFit one LED only; shared 1k resistor. Not a safety indicator.\nGPIO21 may pulse during ROM boot/UART activity."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 86.36 0)
		(effects
